# PromptVault SDLC

- Backlog: [EPICS.md](../../EPICS.md). State: [.cursor/sprint-state.json](../sprint-state.json).
- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at session start.
- One task ID per branch (`task/<ID>-<slug>`) and one PR per task.
- Do not skip dependencies; verify IDs are in `completedTasks` before starting.
- Update `sprint-state.json` after merge: append completed ID, clear `currentTask`.
- Set `blocked` with a reason instead of guessing when stuck.
- Out-of-scope items belong to E7 in EPICS — do not implement unless the user explicitly asks.
